      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cab4a40e9def58e",
      "translationZh": "LeRobot v0.5.0 大幅扩展了支持的硬件阵容——从机械臂、移动机器人，到完整的人形机器人。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "02b71bf1ec773724",
      "translationZh": "Unitree G1 人形机器人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "803a65d6e83aeeee",
      "translationZh": "本次发布中最重大的硬件新增支持：全面支持 Unitree G1 人形机器人。这是 LeRobot 首次集成人形机器人，而且支持非常全面：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1caa751aa5ce9912",
      "translationZh": "移动：在环境中行走、导航和移动。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "408005b1acc00ddc",
      "translationZh": "操作：执行灵巧的物体操作任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac7de372bc0aaecd",
      "translationZh": "遥操作：通过直观的遥操作界面远程控制 G1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "95702f6fe4038213",
      "translationZh": "全身控制（WBC）：同时协调移动与操作，以完成复杂的现实世界任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9dbd53d9ff959f56",
      "translationZh": "G1 的集成标志着 LeRobot 向通用机器人迈出了重要一步——从桌面机械臂拓展到全身具身 AI。按照文档亲自试试吧。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b10f8b5e048f0901",
      "translationZh": "OpenArm 与 OpenArm Mini",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "699228110c6d5d4a",
      "translationZh": "我们新增了对 OpenArm 机器人及其配套的 OpenArm Mini 遥操作设备的支持。OpenArm 是一款功能强大的机械臂，已全面集成到 LeRobot 中，而 Mini 则是与其自然适配的遥操作设备。两者均支持双臂配置，可搭建双臂系统来完成更复杂的操作任务。请查看文档了解详情。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5e7ceb0ea8e641e6",
      "translationZh": "更多机器人",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b3173a4d2b54b720",
      "translationZh": "硬件生态系统持续壮大：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2ad702902ec1babd",
      "translationZh": "Earth Rover：我们首次集成的移动机器人，将 LeRobot 带入户外导航与地面机器人领域。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fd54b8d3f25018e8",
      "translationZh": "OMX Robot：一款新的机械臂，支持可配置的夹爪设置和校准。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "aff89521a74ef128",
      "translationZh": "SO-100/SO-101 整合：我们已将 SO-100 和 SO-101 的实现统一到一个更简洁的代码库中，其中也包括双臂配置。代码重复更少，维护更轻松，机器人依然同样出色。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "0512a15708808ca2",
      "translationZh": "CAN 总线电机",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc012153ce407a23",
      "translationZh": "新增通过 CAN（控制器局域网）总线连接的电机控制器支持，为使用更高性能的执行器打开了大门：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8249a833ecb7deef",
      "translationZh": "RobStride：一款基于 CAN 的电机控制器，适用于高扭矩应用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78a9eab9fbc6e7d3",
      "translationZh": "Damiao：另一款 CAN 总线电机控制器，进一步扩大了兼容硬件的范围。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1985959bc133cbca",
      "translationZh": "这些新增支持意味着，LeRobot 现在可以驱动现有 Dynamixel 和 Feetech 生态系统之外更多种类的专业级执行器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "11bb08dce3c51f64",
      "translationZh": "策略：不断扩展的模型库",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0395fd2a1c2e1da4",
      "translationZh": "此版本为 LeRobot 带来了六种新的策略和技术，拓展了开源机器人学习的能力边界。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e4aabfada3ce1332",
      "translationZh": "Pi0-FAST：自回归 VLA",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8c5d37ed5f39002d",
      "translationZh": "Pi0-FAST 通过 FAST（频域动作序列词元化）将自回归视觉-语言-动作模型引入 LeRobot。与 Pi0 的流匹配方法不同，Pi0-FAST 使用自回归动作专家模型（基于 Gemma 300M）来生成离散化的动作词元，从而支持：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "81a3ff7be1c50ff5",
      "translationZh": "FAST 词元化：使用专用的 FAST 动作词元化器将动作转换为词元，以进行自回归解码。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d478c6bcb7277184",
      "translationZh": "灵活解码：可配置温度和最大解码步数，以平衡速度与质量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0a028489f1349626",
      "translationZh": "兼容 RTC：可与实时分块（Real-Time Chunking，见下一节）配合使用，实现响应迅速的推理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "84beb85be05dd30f",
      "translationZh": "实时分块（RTC）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "413dc79a3cdcc495",
      "translationZh": "实时分块是 Physical Intelligence 提出的一种推理时技术，可显著提升流匹配策略的响应能力。RTC 无需等待整个动作块执行完毕再重新规划，而是持续将新的预测与正在执行的动作融合，从而产生更平滑、响应更灵敏的行为。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a963e2800b572a91",
      "translationZh": "RTC 并非独立策略，而是一项可接入现有流匹配策略（Pi0 系列、SmolVLA 和 Diffusion）的增强功能。可通过 --policy.rtc_config.enabled=true 进行配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9d2360be831022f9",
      "translationZh": "对于延迟至关重要的现实场景部署而言，这是一项颠覆性的改进。技术细节请阅读原始论文及我们的文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a7fdc26c29e65952",
      "translationZh": "Wall-X 是一种基于 Qwen2.5-VL 构建的新 VLA 策略，采用流匹配进行动作预测。它将 Qwen2.5-VL 强大的视觉语言理解能力与流匹配头相结合，实现跨具身形态的机器人控制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d45123196c40500c",
      "translationZh": "X-VLA 为 LeRobot 带来了基于 Florence2 的 VLA。X-VLA 基于微软的 Florence-2 视觉语言模型构建，为 VLA 策略提供了另一种骨干网络，丰富了可用于机器人学习的基础模型种类。设置说明和基础模型请参阅训练指南。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "11c1853983ee3721",
      "translationZh": "SARM（Stage-Aware Reward Modeling，阶段感知奖励建模）致力于解决机器人学习中最棘手的问题之一：长时程任务。它不再对整个回合使用单一的全局线性进度信号，而是通过同时预测任务所处的阶段及该阶段内的进度，以阶段感知的方式对进度进行建模。这使得为复杂的多步骤操作任务训练策略变得容易得多。请按照文档开始尝试使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6e6447f7aad06732",
      "translationZh": "PEFT 支持",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0068",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cb984f440931ed1f",
      "translationZh": "现在，你可以使用 LoRA（以及其他 PEFT 方法）微调大型 VLA，而无需修改核心训练流水线。PEFT 配置位于策略层级，让你只需少量算力，就能轻松地将超大规模基础模型适配到你的特定机器人和任务。阅读文档以了解更多信息。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0069",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "240a6a7965031959",
      "translationZh": "数据集：更快录制，更快训练",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0070",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fea50a32e038bb17",
      "translationZh": "本次发布对数据集流水线进行了重大性能改进，显著加快了数据采集和训练的速度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0071",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "5656e2744996d18d",
      "translationZh": "流式视频编码",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0072",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b7741d5c535b5a84",
      "translationZh": "以前，录制数据集意味着每个回合结束后都要等待视频编码完成。现在不再如此。借助流式视频编码，视频帧在采集时就会被实时编码——这意味着回合之间的等待时间为零。完成一个回合后，即可立即开始下一个。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0073",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "61f04412fa44068a",
      "translationZh": "流式编码还支持自动检测硬件编码器，因此，如果你的系统配备了 GPU 加速的视频编码器，LeRobot 就会自动使用它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0074",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f31a3205634e4c9",
      "translationZh": "流式编码的性能可能因硬件和录制配置（摄像头数量、分辨率等）的不同而存在显著差异。启用之前，请务必查阅流式视频编码文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0075",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "571504a53724e3c3",
      "translationZh": "图像训练速度提升至 10 倍，编码速度提升至 3 倍",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0076",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "238eb1ba0f7b93fc",
      "translationZh": "在底层，我们修复了关键的数据访问瓶颈，并全面改进了图像处理：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0077",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1945e5c8a9663537",
      "translationZh": "图像训练速度提升至 10 倍：改进了对图像变换的支持，并修复了此前在不易察觉的情况下拖慢训练速度的数据访问瓶颈。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0078",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ac49b2414ac98e19",
      "translationZh": "编码速度提升至 3 倍：在不使用流式编码时，所有平台现在都默认采用并行编码，并根据数据集类型（视频或图像）动态调整压缩级别。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5543bf29d02d9337",
      "translationZh": "更高的 CPU 利用率：在录制和创建数据集时，更高效地使用资源。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "30b410f8510f5971",
      "translationZh": "新的数据集工具",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3386e9e6366071fa",
      "translationZh": "数据集编辑工具包仍在不断扩充：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "051aef099d34b864",
      "translationZh": "子任务支持：在回合内标注和查询子任务，以支持分层任务学习。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "78810f990eb8d2e3",
      "translationZh": "图像转视频：将现有的基于图像的数据集转换为视频格式，以提高存储效率，并支持在每个视频文件中存储多个回合。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec0ae68200624c12",
      "translationZh": "更多编辑操作：新增用于检查数据集的 info 操作、任务修改工具，并对现有操作（拆分、合并、特征编辑）进行了多项修复。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5e7fc4b44d1e8a8b",
      "translationZh": "开放更多选项：可配置的视频编解码器、容差设置和元数据缓冲区大小，让你能够对数据集创建过程进行细粒度控制。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3aff3c869d3b22b1",
      "translationZh": "EnvHub：来自 Hub 的环境",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "601932d213d17502",
      "translationZh": "EnvHub 提供了一种在 LeRobot 中使用仿真环境的新方式：直接从 Hugging Face Hub 加载环境。现在，你不必在本地安装环境包并配置注册流程，只需让 LeRobot 指向一个 Hub 仓库，它就会处理一切——下载环境代码、将其注册到 Gymnasium，并使其可用于训练和评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b7e616597afd912",
      "translationZh": "Hub 环境使用 HubEnvConfig，由它下载并执行远程 make_env 函数：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e2954b384d63ec4",
      "translationZh": "这降低了向社区分享自定义仿真环境的门槛。将你的环境打包并推送到 Hub，任何人都可以在其中进行训练。查看文档以了解更多信息。这里有一个帮助你入门的示例：LeIsaac x LeRobot EnvHub 教程。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9387aa458de8c149",
      "translationZh": "我们集成了 NVIDIA IsaacLab-Arena，为 LeRobot 带来了 GPU 加速仿真。IsaacLab-Arena 提供了一系列在 NVIDIA 的 Isaac Sim 上运行的操作任务，通过大规模并行的环境实例实现快速强化学习。此次集成包含专门的前处理和后处理步骤，并与 LeRobot 的训练流水线完全兼容。请查看文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "708426e0e74cc660",
      "translationZh": "代码库：现代化的基础",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5661deb98506e51",
      "translationZh": "此版本对代码库进行了现代化升级：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "97eb541cd1c60de5",
      "translationZh": "Python 3.12+：LeRobot 现在要求最低使用 Python 3.12，以支持现代语法并获得更好的性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2eec9baa625c6b99",
      "translationZh": "Transformers v5：我们已迁移至 Hugging Face Transformers v5，与最新的模型生态保持同步。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c9e9a39e4051a40e",
      "translationZh": "第三方策略插件：与 v0.4.0 的硬件插件系统一样，你现在可以将自定义策略注册为可安装的软件包——通过 pip install lerobot_policy_mypolicy 安装，然后使用 --policy.type=mypolicy 调用。无需更改核心库。请参照文档了解具体做法。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8b77642dd018a31",
      "translationZh": "远程 Rerun 可视化：使用 Rerun 远程可视化机器人的遥测数据，支持压缩图像，以节省流式传输的带宽。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "be014bed225e6583",
      "translationZh": "安装改进：新增了 uv 安装说明，明确了设置步骤，并改进了依赖管理。现在已清晰记录按顺序执行的安装步骤。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cffe7b6d3d18df19",
      "translationZh": "文档版本管理：文档现已按版本管理，因此你始终可以找到与你已安装的发行版本相匹配的文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b15c61b102bb7749",
      "translationZh": "PyTorch 版本升级：更新了 PyTorch 版本范围限制，以支持 NVIDIA Blackwell GPUs。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "b2e0239e67cf516b",
      "translationZh": "社区与生态系统",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8c80ca7d4c1f8750",
      "translationZh": "Discord 焕新：更新了这个最活跃的社区中心，使频道组织更加合理。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0c03aeb5da1ae8aa",
      "translationZh": "GitHub README、模板与自动标签：焕然一新的 README、全新的 issue 和 PR 模板、贡献指南，以及工单自动标签功能——让每个人都能更轻松地参与贡献。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b0ff16404418ca53",
      "translationZh": "ICLR 2026 论文录用：LeRobot 论文已被 ICLR 2026 录用！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0dd432af5446a52f",
      "translationZh": "LeRobot Visualizer 焕新：可视化工具迎来更新，新增了数据集可视化徽章，并改进了功能。快来看看吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8cfae6af264452b5",
      "translationZh": "LeRobot Annotation Studio：这是一个 HuggingFace Space，旨在让你轻松用自然语言子任务为数据集中的每一时刻添加标注。快来看看吧！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "68b600e35257625a",
      "translationZh": "结语",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5dfbf0db47ef5a39",
      "translationZh": "除了这些重磅功能，v0.5.0 还在整个代码库中带来了数百项错误修复、文档改进、CI/CD 增强以及使用体验优化。从更完善的类型检查到更稳健的测试基础设施，我们正在投入资源夯实基础，确保 LeRobot 在规模不断扩大时依然可靠且易于维护。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe60eb61aa78925e",
      "translationZh": "我们衷心感谢社区中的每一位成员——无论是贡献者、用户还是合作伙伴——帮助 LeRobot 成长为今天的模样。每一份错误报告、每一个 PR、每一次讨论，都让这个项目变得更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5493546dadda0d85",
      "translationZh": "更多精彩即将到来，敬请期待 🤗 从这里开始吧！——LeRobot 团队 ❤️",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4eafb71943742f25",
      "translationZh": "一个大惊喜马上就要来了，敬请期待！👕",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
